      "visualHeaderTooltip": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'#: Place by invite score among the artists the page filters leave (1 = best).\nArtist: Spotify artist name; 4 letters of the Spotify ID are added when two artists share a name.\nNew song to film: The artist''s song that came out after their last NDN visit and isn''t on NDN''s YouTube yet; if several, the one with the most TikTok videos.\nFound on: Where the new song''s buzz shows: TikTok, Spotify or both.\nOPM top 30 place: The new song''s place in the OPM top 30 (Top 50 PH + Viral Hits PH + Billboard PH Hot 100).\nList points: The new song''s points over the three lists (most = 300).\nTikTok videos using it: Videos on TikTok using the new song''s official sound (sound page, latest weekly count).\nChange in 4 weeks: Change in that number of TikTok videos over 4 weeks; +50% = half as many again.\nSpotify plays per day: Daily Spotify plays of the new song (kworb.net, latest).\nOut since: Release date (Deezer; if missing, the date the TikTok sound appeared).\nArtist TikTok: The artist''s TikTok account: listed by Vic, tagged in NDN captions, or matched from their Instagram name and checked.\nTikTok followers: Followers on the artist''s TikTok (public profile, weekly).\nBest spot on Spotify PH chart: Best place on Spotify''s Philippines weekly top 200 in the last 8 weeks (1 = top). Empty = not on it.\nFans asking NDN: Different people asking NDN for this artist in YouTube + TikTok comments, last 12 months.\nFound via: How the artist got on the list: an NDN artist or Vic''s list, Spotify''s Philippines weekly chart, or Spotify''s Viral Hits Philippines playlist.\nLast NDN post: Latest NDN post featuring the artist.'"
                }
              }
            },
